  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9cadd5b167c8ea0b",
      "translationZh": "我们很高兴地宣布，全新的适用于 Amazon SageMaker 的 Hugging Face Embedding Container 现已正式可用（GA）。AWS 客户现在可以在 SageMaker 上高效部署嵌入模型，构建生成式 AI 应用，包括检索增强生成（RAG）应用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "106d9bc635ba8225",
      "translationZh": "在这篇博客中，我们将向你展示如何使用全新的 Hugging Face Embedding Container，将 Snowflake/snowflake-arctic-embed-l、BAAI/bge-large-en-v1.5 或 sentence-transformers/all-MiniLM-L6-v2 等开放嵌入模型部署到 Amazon SageMaker 上进行推理。我们将部署 Snowflake/snowflake-arctic-embed-m-v1.5，它是用于检索的最佳开放嵌入模型之一——你可以在 MTEB 排行榜上查看它的排名。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ad1acafb17b3c059",
      "translationZh": "本示例涵盖：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a1ffaa859f334223",
      "translationZh": "1. 设置开发环境",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "102eeccf123b65a4",
      "translationZh": "2. 获取全新的 Hugging Face Embedding Container",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "971a9fdafb02212f",
      "translationZh": "3. 将 Snowflake Arctic 部署到 Amazon SageMaker",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "78da5dcf8a5fe26e",
      "translationZh": "4. 运行推理并评估其性能",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "37c71b24a6ba9137",
      "translationZh": "5. 删除模型和端点",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "2d7d6443f67b8d8b",
      "translationZh": "什么是 Hugging Face Embedding Container？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7eaafc51dc5d7204",
      "translationZh": "Hugging Face Embedding Container 是一款全新、专门构建的推理容器，可在安全且受托管的环境中轻松部署嵌入模型。该 DLC 由 Text Embedding Inference (TEI) 提供支持，TEI 是一种用于部署嵌入模型并提供推理服务的解决方案，速度极快且内存利用高效。TEI 支持对最流行的模型进行高性能嵌入提取，包括 FlagEmbedding、Ember、GTE 和 E5。TEI 实现了许多功能，例如：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "19b60bb67a3a6663",
      "translationZh": "无需模型图编译步骤",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3d44ace22a0ead6f",
      "translationZh": "体积小巧的 docker 镜像和快速启动",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9d7f481a1af7e0d4",
      "translationZh": "基于词元的动态批处理",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ab59f0a898787e45",
      "translationZh": "使用 Flash Attention、Candle 和 cuBLASLt 优化用于推理的 transformers 代码",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3b7c8b0beb6a653c",
      "translationZh": "Safetensors 权重加载",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7af61301f25f5c09",
      "translationZh": "可用于生产环境（使用 Open Telemetry 进行分布式追踪、提供 Prometheus 指标）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a704f550dd097f92",
      "translationZh": "TEI 支持以下模型架构",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ccbf11a06815b192",
      "translationZh": "BERT/CamemBERT，例如 BAAI/bge-large-en-v1.5 或 Snowflake/snowflake-arctic-embed-m-v1.5",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "271cc0f2b40795f4",
      "translationZh": "XLM-RoBERTa，例如 sentence-transformers/paraphrase-xlm-r-multilingual-v1",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a80eea3fffc2e6be",
      "translationZh": "NomicBert，例如 jinaai/jina-embeddings-v2-base-en",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "aa4f40233768bd49",
      "translationZh": "JinaBert，例如 nomic-ai/nomic-embed-text-v1.5",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "10e297bf3002314a",
      "translationZh": "让我们开始吧！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "a1ffaa859f334223",
      "translationZh": "1. 设置开发环境",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "69e6ddbd7d62ea69",
      "translationZh": "我们将使用 sagemaker python SDK 将 Snowflake Arctic 部署到 Amazon SageMaker。我们需要确保已配置 AWS 账户并安装了 sagemaker python SDK。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9c5bb084cd1d69b1",
      "translationZh": "如果你打算在本地环境中使用 Sagemaker，就需要能够访问一个具有 Sagemaker 所需权限的 IAM Role。你可以在这里了解更多相关信息。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "102eeccf123b65a4",
      "translationZh": "2. 获取新的 Hugging Face 嵌入容器",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "40e2f420b13276ac",
      "translationZh": "与部署常规 Hugging Face 模型相比，我们首先需要获取容器 URI，并通过指向该镜像的 image_uri 将其提供给 HuggingFaceModel 模型类。要在 Amazon SageMaker 中获取新的 Hugging Face 嵌入容器，我们可以使用 sagemaker SDK 提供的 get_huggingface_llm_image_uri 方法。此方法允许我们获取所需 Hugging Face 嵌入容器的 URI。需要特别注意的是，TEI 有分别适用于 cpu 和 gpu 的 2 个不同版本，因此我们创建一个辅助函数，根据实例类型获取正确的镜像 URI。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "971a9fdafb02212f",
      "translationZh": "3. 将 Snowflake Arctic 部署到 Amazon SageMaker",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1f2b7eddcd8bf234",
      "translationZh": "要将 Snowflake/snowflake-arctic-embed-m-v1.5 部署到 Amazon SageMaker，我们需要创建一个 HuggingFaceModel 模型类，并定义端点配置，包括 HF_MODEL_ID、instance_type 等。我们将使用 c6i.2xlarge 实例类型，它具有 4 个 Intel Ice-Lake vCPU、8GB 内存，每小时费用约为 $0.204。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f41f7058408fd922",
      "translationZh": "创建 HuggingFaceModel 后，我们就可以使用 deploy 方法将其部署到 Amazon SageMaker。我们将使用 ml.c6i.2xlarge 实例类型部署该模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "02d078fc3516cf34",
      "translationZh": "SageMaker 现在将创建我们的端点，并将模型部署到该端点。这可能需要约 5 分钟。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "78da5dcf8a5fe26e",
      "translationZh": "4. 运行推理并评估性能",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bd2f54fa86922bee",
      "translationZh": "端点部署完成后，我们就可以在其上运行推理。我们将使用 predictor 的 predict 方法在端点上运行推理。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8540235e5f5a57ba",
      "translationZh": "太棒了！现在我们可以生成嵌入向量了，接下来测试一下模型的性能。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1167c5794b53df17",
      "translationZh": "我们将使用 10 个并发线程，向端点发送 3,900 个请求，并测量端点的平均延迟和吞吐量。每次发送的输入长度为 256 个 token，总计约 100 万个 token。我们决定将输入长度设为 256 个 token，以在较短和较长的输入之间找到合适的平衡。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2ea5d3e27a9d5703",
      "translationZh": "注意：运行负载测试时，请求从欧洲发送，而端点部署在 us-east-1。这会给请求带来额外的网络延迟开销。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6920414b17e7c760",
      "translationZh": "发送 3,900 个请求，也就是为 100 万个 token 生成嵌入向量，大约耗时 841 秒。这意味着我们每秒大约可以处理 5 个请求。但请记住，其中包含了从欧洲到 us-east-1 的网络延迟。通过 cloudwatch 查看端点延迟时，我们可以看到，在 10 个并发请求下，嵌入模型的延迟为 2 秒。对于一个每月费用约 150 美元的小型老旧 CPU 实例来说，这个表现非常出色。你可以将模型部署到 GPU 实例上，以缩短推理时间。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "abfc9a862b1b531a",
      "translationZh": "注意：我们在配备 1 块 NVIDIA A10G GPU 的 ml.g5.xlarge 上运行了相同的测试。为 100 万个 token 生成嵌入向量大约耗时 30 秒。这意味着我们每秒大约可以处理 130 个请求。在 10 个并发请求下，端点延迟为 4 毫秒。在 Amazon SageMaker 上，ml.g5.xlarge 的费用约为每小时 $1.408。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "33ee738bff7cc627",
      "translationZh": "GPU 实例比 CPU 实例快得多，但也更昂贵。如果你想批量生成嵌入向量，可以使用 GPU 实例。如果你想以较低成本运行一个小型端点，可以使用 CPU 实例。我们计划今后针对 Hugging Face Embedding Container 开展专门的基准测试。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "37c71b24a6ba9137",
      "translationZh": "5. 删除模型和端点",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3e622bb7e123373e",
      "translationZh": "为清理资源，我们可以删除模型和端点。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "89db2ad881f29c18",
      "translationZh": "结论",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3e4f71bb87d56d23",
      "translationZh": "全新的 Hugging Face Embedding Container 让你能够轻松地将 Snowflake/snowflake-arctic-embed-l 等开放嵌入模型部署到 Amazon SageMaker，以进行推理。我们逐步介绍了设置开发环境、获取容器、部署模型以及评估其推理性能的过程。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b87b6ad3cc5a2859",
      "translationZh": "借助这一新容器，客户现在可以轻松部署高性能嵌入模型，从而以更高的效率构建复杂的生成式 AI 应用。我们期待看到你使用面向 Amazon SageMaker 的全新 Hugging Face Embedding Container 构建的成果。如果你有任何问题或反馈，请告诉我们。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
